# Reddit Video Downloader

ReditGrab is a browser-based **Reddit video downloader** for publicly accessible Reddit posts.

The tool lets users paste a supported Reddit post URL, preview the available video, check available quality options, and download the video as an MP4 when supported.

**Live tool:** https://reditgrab.com/

## Features

* Download videos from publicly accessible Reddit posts
* Preview the video before downloading
* Show available video quality options
* Handle common Reddit URL formats
* MP4 output when available
* Separate video/audio stream handling when supported
* Works in modern desktop and mobile browsers
* No desktop application required
* No Reddit account is required for publicly accessible posts

## Supported Reddit URLs

ReditGrab is designed to work with common Reddit URL formats, including:

* `reddit.com/r/...`
* `old.reddit.com/...`
* `redd.it/...`
* Supported `v.redd.it` media URLs

The Reddit post must be publicly accessible. Private communities, deleted posts, login-only content, and unavailable media cannot be retrieved.

## How It Works

Reddit-hosted videos can use separate video and audio streams.

When a supported public post is submitted, the tool identifies the available media and determines which video qualities are available for that particular source.

If a compatible audio stream exists, the download process can combine the available tracks into an MP4 where supported.

The available resolution depends on the original Reddit media rather than being artificially upscaled.

## Basic Usage

1. Open a publicly accessible Reddit video post.
2. Copy the post URL.
3. Open [ReditGrab](https://reditgrab.com/).
4. Paste the Reddit URL.
5. Preview the detected video.
6. Select an available quality if multiple options are provided.
7. Download the MP4.

## Limitations

ReditGrab is intended for publicly accessible Reddit-hosted media.

It cannot access:

* Private communities
* Deleted Reddit posts
* Content requiring Reddit authentication
* Media that is no longer publicly available
* Videos hosted exclusively on external platforms

Available resolutions and audio depend on the source media.

## Related Reddit Tools

